    private String initRegiPic;
    private LocalDateTime initRegiDttm;
    private String finalRvisPic;
    private LocalDateTime finalRvisDttm;
}
```

```java
// DTO — API 요청/응답 전용 (Entity와 분리)
@Getter
@NoArgsConstructor
@AllArgsConstructor
@Builder
public class UserRespDto {
    private Long id;
    private String loginId;
    private String name;
    private String role;
